**/dist
**/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.worktrees
.turbo
.nessie
.playwright-mcp
macos
remote
tmp
output
testing
simulation
e2e
assets
UI
docs
memory
*.png
*.log
**/.DS_Store
